# Tangerine Compiler — Library Module (FULL)
# Self-hosting compiler written in Tangerine
#
# This is the FULL library entry point that re-exports all compiler modules,
# including the non-bootstrap tooling modules. The bootstrap kernel subset of
# this module lives in lib_kernel.tg (see bootstrap/compiler_kernel.manifest).
# The self-hosting bootstrap compiles lib_kernel.tg instead of this module to
# keep the bootstrap compiler closure minimal. This module remains the entry
# point for users embedding the complete compiler.

#| rationale
   objective: Provide a unified interface to the Tangerine compiler
   why: Makes the compiler usable as both a library and executable
   how: Re-export all submodules with proper visibility
   tradeoffs:
     - Larger compile-time import
     - More flexible API access
|#

